    <td>Cube算力规格</td>
    <td>353T/376T @BF16,FP16</td>
    <td>426T@BF16,FP16 757T@FP8,HIFP8,MXFP8,INT8 1514T@MXFP4</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Vector算力规格(FP16)</td>
    <td>23.5T</td>
